# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# `papers/`. Local only, as of 2026-09-23, on explicit instruction.
#
# Four files left the index: two published PDFs (Orlenko 2025 on gene-drug
# targets in Alzheimer's, McVeety 2026 introducing OKF), README.md, and
# _INDEX.md. 5.5MB, and both PDFs are third-party papers obtained elsewhere.
#
# The cost is that _INDEX.md goes with them, so a clone has no record of which
# papers this work rests on — not even their titles. No tracked file cites a
# line inside `papers/`, so the citation checker is unaffected.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
papers/

